# sdist composition (spec 13-09-26, M1.3 sdist / source-install policy, requirements §6).
# The sdist is SOURCE: it must build on any platform and never carries the native compiler
# (the wheel legs stage it at pythscribe/_bin/ from the finalized release binary). setup.py
# (auto-included) carries the tag hook and VERIFIES the produced tarball has no binary -- a
# removed prune line here is RED there, not silently a 7 MB "source" tarball.
prune pythscribe/_bin
